  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/obad#Obad.1.3",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/obad",
    "canonical_ref": "Obad.1.3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Superbia cordis tui extulit te, habitantem in scissuris petrarum, exaltantem solium tuum; qui dicis in corde tuo: Quis detrahet me in terram?",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/obad#Obad.1.4",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/obad",
    "canonical_ref": "Obad.1.4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Si exaltatus fueris ut aquila, et si inter sidera posueris nidum tuum, inde detraham te, dicit Dominus.",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/obad#Obad.1.5",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/obad",
    "canonical_ref": "Obad.1.5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Si fures introissent ad te, si latrones per noctem, quomodo conticuisses? nonne furati essent sufficientia sibi? Si vindemiatores introissent ad te, numquid saltem racemum reliquissent tibi?",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/obad#Obad.1.6",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/obad",
    "canonical_ref": "Obad.1.6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quomodo scrutati sunt Esau; investigaverunt abscondita ejus?",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/obad#Obad.1.7",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/obad",
    "canonical_ref": "Obad.1.7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Usque ad terminum emiserunt te: omnes viri fœderis tui illuserunt tibi: invaluerunt adversum te viri pacis tuæ, qui comedunt tecum, ponent insidias subter te; non est prudentia in eo.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/obad#Obad.1.8",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/obad",
    "canonical_ref": "Obad.1.8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Numquid non in die illa, dicit Dominus, perdam sapientes de Idumæa, et prudentiam de monte Esau?",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/obad#Obad.1.9",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/obad",
    "canonical_ref": "Obad.1.9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et timebunt fortes tui a meridie, ut intereat vir de monte Esau.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/obad#Obad.1.10",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/obad",
    "canonical_ref": "Obad.1.10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Propter interfectionem, et propter iniquitatem in fratrem tuum Jacob, operiet te confusio, et peribis in æternum.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/obad#Obad.1.11",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/obad",
    "canonical_ref": "Obad.1.11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "In die cum stares adversus eum, quando capiebant alieni exercitum ejus, et extranei ingrediebantur portas ejus, et super Jerusalem mittebant sortem, tu quoque eras quasi unus ex eis.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/obad#Obad.1.12",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/obad",
    "canonical_ref": "Obad.1.12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et non despicies in die fratris tui, in die peregrinationis ejus: et non lætaberis super filios Juda in die perditionis eorum: et non magnificabis os tuum in die angustiæ.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/obad#Obad.1.13",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/obad",
    "canonical_ref": "Obad.1.13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Neque ingredieris portam populi mei in die ruinæ eorum; neque despicies et tu in malis ejus in die vastitatis illius. Et non emitteris adversus exercitum ejus in die vastitatis illius,",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/obad#Obad.1.14",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/obad",
    "canonical_ref": "Obad.1.14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "neque stabis in exitibus ut interficias eos qui fugerint, et non concludes reliquos ejus in die tribulationis.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
